The bedchamber part 2 is some text that varies. The bedchamber part 2 is "

There is an exit to the east. Don't worry, it is unblocked. There is an exit to the north. Don't worry, it is unblocked. You need an unblocked exit? You should try going south. You need an unguarded exit? You should try going west.".
